---
import Container from "../base/Container.astro";
import Icon from "../ui/Icon.astro";
---

<section
  class="py-24 bg-[#FAF9F6] border-y border-[#B59A73]/20 relative overflow-hidden"
  id="guest-journey"
>
  <!-- Decorative Background Glow -->
  <div
    class="absolute left-[-10%] bottom-0 w-[450px] h-[450px] rounded-full bg-brand-200/10 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <Container>
    <div
      class="text-center max-w-[680px] mx-auto space-y-4 mb-20 animate-fade-in"
    >
      <div
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-200/60 bg-surface/50 backdrop-blur-md"
      >
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-soft-gold"></span>
        <span
          class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold text-brand-700"
          >Akses Undangan Digital Mudah</span
        >
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-brand-950 leading-tight">
        Pengalaman Tamu Membuka <span class="italic font-normal text-soft-gold"
          >Undangan Pernikahan</span
        > yang Sempurna.
      </h2>

      <p
        class="text-text-secondary text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-sans"
      >
        Kami merancang ekosistem undangan pernikahan online yang ramah bagi
        segala usia—mulai dari kemudahan membuka pesan hingga pendaftaran
        kehadiran yang lancar di hari resepsi.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Grid Layout -->
    <div
      class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start z-10"
    >
      <!-- Connective Line (Desktop only) -->
      <div
        class="absolute top-[32px] left-[12.5%] right-[12.5%] h-[1.5px] border-t border-dashed border-[#B59A73]/30 hidden md:block z-0"
      >
      </div>

      <!-- Step 1: Dapat Pesan WhatsApp -->
      <div
        class="relative z-10 group text-center space-y-5 animate-fade-in"
        style="animation-delay: 0.1s;"
      >
        <!-- Timeline Icon Marker -->
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#B59A73]/30 shadow-elevated flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold mx-auto group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:border-[#B59A73]/70 group-hover:bg-brand-950 group-hover:text-cream transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <Icon name="whatsapp" size={24} />
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 max-w-[240px] mx-auto">
          <span
            class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B59A73] font-bold font-sans"
            >Langkah 01</span
          >
          <h4
            class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
          >
            Dapat Pesan WhatsApp
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold">
            Tamu menerima pesan WhatsApp dengan nama mereka tertulis secara
            personal dan mewah tanpa kesan massal (spam).
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Simulated WhatsApp Mini-Bubble -->
        <div
          class="bg-white/80 border border-brand-200/30 p-3 rounded-xl shadow-xs text-left max-w-[200px] mx-auto text-[8.5px] leading-relaxed font-sans text-brand-900"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1.5">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-success"></span>
            <span class="font-extrabold uppercase text-text-muted text-[7px]"
              >WhatsApp Blast</span
            >
          </div>
          Dear <b>Bpk. Hendra & Partner</b>, kami mengundang Anda...
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2: Visual yang Cantik -->
      <div
        class="relative z-10 group text-center space-y-5 animate-fade-in"
        style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"
      >
        <!-- Timeline Icon Marker -->
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#B59A73]/30 shadow-elevated flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold mx-auto group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:border-[#B59A73]/70 group-hover:bg-brand-950 group-hover:text-cream transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <Icon name="sparkles" size={24} />
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 max-w-[240px] mx-auto">
          <span
            class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B59A73] font-bold font-sans"
            >Langkah 02</span
          >
          <h4
            class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
          >
            Visual yang Cantik
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold">
            Undangan terbuka dengan visual yang cantik sesuai preferensi
            pengundang. Serta <i>background music</i> akan terputar otomatis saat
            dibuka.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Simulated Button Cover -->
        <div
          class="w-[140px] py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-200/30 bg-white shadow-xs mx-auto flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-soft-gold/60 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <span
            class="text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-950 font-black flex items-center gap-1.5 font-sans"
          >
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-soft-gold animate-pulse"
            ></span>
            Buka Undangan
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3: Membaca Informasi Acara -->
      <div
        class="relative z-10 group text-center space-y-5 animate-fade-in"
        style="animation-delay: 0.3s;"
      >
        <!-- Timeline Icon Marker -->
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#B59A73]/30 shadow-elevated flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold mx-auto group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:border-[#B59A73]/70 group-hover:bg-brand-950 group-hover:text-cream transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <Icon name="calendar" size={24} />
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 max-w-[240px] mx-auto">
          <span
            class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B59A73] font-bold font-sans"
            >Langkah 03</span
          >
          <h4
            class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
          >
            Membaca Informasi Acara
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold">
            Tamu dengan mudah membaca informasi lengkap tentang hari H, akad,
            resepsi, countdown, serta galeri momen indah.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Simulated Event Details Card -->
        <div
          class="bg-white/80 border border-brand-200/30 p-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-xs text-center max-w-[170px] mx-auto text-[8.5px] font-bold text-brand-950 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5"
        >
          <span class="text-[7.5px] uppercase tracking-wider text-soft-gold"
            >Hari Pernikahan</span
          >
          <span class="text-[9px] font-extrabold">Sabtu, 20 Juni 2026</span>
          <span class="text-[7.5px] font-semibold text-text-muted"
            >10:00 - Selesai</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4: Navigasi Peta Akurat -->
      <div
        class="relative z-10 group text-center space-y-5 animate-fade-in"
        style="animation-delay: 0.4s;"
      >
        <!-- Timeline Icon Marker -->
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#B59A73]/30 shadow-elevated flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold mx-auto group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:border-[#B59A73]/70 group-hover:bg-brand-950 group-hover:text-cream transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <Icon name="map-pin" size={24} />
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 max-w-[240px] mx-auto">
          <span
            class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B59A73] font-bold font-sans"
            >Langkah 04</span
          >
          <h4
            class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
          >
            Navigasi Peta Akurat
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold">
            Tamu mendapatkan rute langsung dengan sekali ketukan, terhubung ke
            Google Maps/Waze demi mencegah salah jalan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Simulated Map Badge -->
        <div
          class="bg-white/80 border border-brand-200/30 p-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-xs text-center max-w-[160px] mx-auto text-[8.5px] font-bold text-brand-950 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5"
        >
          <div
            class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-soft-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-soft-gold"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-2.5 h-2.5"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span>Buka Peta Lokasi</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
